---
import { getSingleton } from '../../lib/keystatic';
const { services } = await getSingleton('home');
const icons = ['↗', '⌘', '◫', '◎'];
---
<section id="servicios" class="section shell">
  <div class="section-intro"><span class="eyebrow">LO QUE HAGO</span><h2>{services.heading}</h2><p>Diseño y desarrollo conectados, con una solución pensada para lo que tu negocio necesita.</p></div>
  <div class="service-list">{services.items.map((item, i) => (
    <a class="service-row" href={`/contact?servicio=${encodeURIComponent(item.name)}`}>
      <div class="service-top"><span class="service-number">{item.step}</span><span class="service-icon" aria-hidden="true">{icons[i]}</span></div>
      <h3>{item.name}</h3><p>{item.description}</p><span class="service-bottom">Hablemos de tu idea <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></span>
    </a>
  ))}</div>
</section>
